                                                "sense_id": "d8673f9c-302e-3d01-bbc6-2ec0e72483c8",
                                                "text": "Ordinary people have already been face-swapped into videos for humorous or prank purposes and there is no reason to believe that abusers, harassers, stalkers, and blackmailers will not soon be face-swapping victims into compromising video as part of their arsenal."
                                            }
